    art: 
    arrival: 'Pip[happy]: Hi! I''m Pip! Can I have a room that isn''t dark? And next
      to somebody?

      Not the crying lady though. She makes me sad.'
    story:
    - 'Pip: I''m looking for my kite. It got stuck in a tree by the lake. A long
      time ago.'
    - 'Pip[sad]: I asked the crying lady if she''d seen it. She just cried more.
      Sorry, Gloria.'
    - 'Pip[happy]: The groundskeeper says there''s a red kite in the big pine! It
      has to be mine!'
    - 'Pip[happy]: It IS mine! Mum sewed my name on the tail. I can go home now,
      can''t I?'
    checkout: 'Pip[happy]: You can have my marble. It''s the shiny one. Bye!'
    keepsake: Shiny Marble
